\newlabel{tab:nasa-main-results}{{5}{14}{Recording-level run-to-failure validation on NASA IMS using the shared nominal representation and local operational-radius calibration. Lead time is measured relative to the documented end of the experiment.\relax }{table.caption.14}{}}
